extends /specs/page-structure/layout.jade

block content
    h1 Mobile slide

    p Mobile slide effect, creating off-screen slide panel functionality.
    p
        strong Note:
        | this functionality usually used for hidden containers on mobile, you can see a demo on #[a(href="../../ux3/components/tabs/") Tab component]
    section.source_section
        h2 Getting Started
        markdown
            p In your document, include a link with class `w-slide__btn` to toggle any container hold the id of `data-slide-target` attribute
        code.src-html.source_visible
            a.w-slide__btn(href="#" data-slide-target="id") test
                div(id="id")
                    p tab111 You can activate a tab or pill navigation without writing any JavaScript by simply specifying on an element.
                        | Adding the nav and nav-tabs classes to the tab ul will apply the Bootstrap

    section.source_section
        h2 Demo
        p please activate the clear view with mobile viewport to see the examples bellow.
        .source_example
            a.w-slide__btn(href="#" data-slide-target="#id") test

            div(id="id")
                p tab111 You can activate a tab or pill navigation without writing any JavaScript by simply specifying on an element.
                    | Adding the nav and nav-tabs classes to the tab ul will apply the Bootstrap

            a.w-slide__btn(href="#" data-slide-target="#id1") test

            div(id="id1")
                p tab111 You can activate a tab or pill navigation without writing any JavaScript by simply specifying on an element.
                    | Adding the nav and nav-tabs classes to the tab ul will apply the Bootstrap
    | #{''}
